For anyone wondering how to solve, checking the permissions first solved it for me and then you never call `requestCameraPermissionsAsync` if it's already been granted. 

```
const requestPermissions = async () => {
      const { granted } = await Camera.getCameraPermissionsAsync();
      if (granted) {
        setHasPermission(true);
        return;
      }
      const { status } = await Camera.requestCameraPermissionsAsync();
      setHasPermission(status === 'granted');
    };
```

